            "Path": "Audio/VOC_JP/JP_CH0190/CH0190_MemorialLobby_5_1",
            "LocalizeEN": "Oh, uh, I mean... It's not that much of a difference...\n\nIt's just... I refuse to believe that my weight changed that much....\n\nAbsolutely no way... Right?"
